---
title: AdviseCare - Activity Diagram - WF4 Programme Head Reports
---

flowchart TD
    S((Start)) --> A1[Programme Head opens the reports page]
    A1 --> A2[Choose a date range]
    A2 --> D1{Dates valid? to not before from}
    D1 -->|No| A2
    D1 -->|Yes| A3[Filter by advisor, support type, category, subject, stage or status]
    A3 --> D2{Which report?}
    D2 -->|Cases| B1[List the cases opened in the range with days to close]
    D2 -->|Caseload| B2[Total, open and closed cases and average days to close per current advisor]
    B1 --> D3{Export?}
    B2 --> D3
    D3 -->|No| X((End))
    D3 -->|Yes| C1[Choose xlsx, csv or pdf]
    C1 --> C2[System generates the file on the fly and records reportExported]
    C2 --> X
